<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:30:06 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</link><description>美国陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了出现大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video'&gt;美国陆军引爆爱荷华州米德尔敦的爆炸物储藏室&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Army Detonates Explosives Cache in Middletown, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</link><description>科技股的抛售使得投资者迈克尔·伯里(Michael Burry)在抛售以科技股为主的纳斯达克100指数的看跌期权后，他的股票多头头寸多于空头头寸。迈克尔·伯里因2008年做空美国抵押贷款市场而闻名。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts'&gt;迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Michael Burry Is More Long Than Short After Dumping Nasdaq Puts&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</link><description>由于股市持续抛售以及关键的通胀数据增强了对美联储进一步加息的押注，金价跌破每盎司 3,500 美元。金价下跌 3.7%，至每盎司 3,426.77 美元。近期金价暴跌步伐加快，上周金价暴跌近9%，有望连续第三个月跌幅超过6%。彭博社的迈克·麦格隆 (Mike McGlone) 加入讨论。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video'&gt;黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:20:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国威胁对巴西飞机征收关税，巴西航空工业公司股价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/embraer-sinks-most-since-may-as-us-proposes-brazil-aircraft-levy</link><description>在美国提议对巴西飞机征收 10% 关税后，巴西航空工业公司 (Embraer SA) 股价创下六个多月来最大跌幅，威胁到该飞机制造商在其最重要市场之一的业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/embraer-sinks-most-since-may-as-us-proposes-brazil-aircraft-levy'&gt;美国威胁对巴西飞机征收关税，巴西航空工业公司股价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Embraer Shares Sink as US Threatens Brazil Aircraft Tariff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/embraer-sinks-most-since-may-as-us-proposes-brazil-aircraft-levy</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:02:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>市场中值得庆幸的一件事</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</link><description>国债对冲再次发挥作用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for'&gt;市场中值得庆幸的一件事&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：One Thing In Markets To Be Thankful For&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>